{{Wireless embedded system |brand=Amigo |model=APH50C |revision= |manuf_country=Taiwan |is_manuf=No |type=access point |fcc_date=02/14/2019 |fcc_id=RC6-APH50C |pwr_v=12 |pwr_amp=1.25 |cpu1_brand=Qualcomm |cpu1_model=IPQ4018;IPQ4018, 0VV, NE818KRP, E081800; |cpu1_cspeed=710 |cpu1_cores=4 |fla1=32 |fla1_brand=Macronix |fla1_model=MX25L25635EMI-10G |ram1=256 |ram1_brand=Winbond |ram1_model= |expansion_if_types=USB 2.0 |expansion_usb_num=1 |wi1_chip1_brand=Qualcomm |wi1_chip1_model=IPQ4018;IPQ4018, 0VV, NE818KRP, E081800; |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_txchains=2 |wi1_rxchains=2 |wi1_sstreams=2 |wi2_chip1_brand=Qualcomm |wi2_chip1_model=IPQ4018;IPQ4018, 0VV, NE818KRP, E081800; |wi2_802dot11_protocols=an+ac |wi2_txchains=2 |wi2_rxchains=2 |wi2_sstreams=2 |eth_cpu=true |sw_brand=Qualcomm Atheros |sw_model=QCA8072;Q, QCA8072, 0VV, PU80224J, U080200; |lan_speed=1GbE |lan_ports=2 |addl_chips=SimpleLink Ultra-low Power Wireless MCU for Bluetooth LE;Texas Instruments;CC2640;CC2640, F128, TI 7BJ, P789 G4;1; |802dot11_protocols=abgn+ac }} {{TagLine|Indoor Access Point}}
"EPMBAPH50CX1BXXX" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos.
The [[Amigo APH51C]] is identical except that it has external antennae instead of internal.
